{"id":"n68801-1-8","stage":3,"title":"운동량 · 运动量","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n68801-1-8-1","ko":"밥을 적게 먹는데도 살이 안 빠져요.","zh":"我吃得已经很少了，可体重还是降不下来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"밥을","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적게","meaning":"少，小，欠缺","explanation":"적다：少，小，欠缺；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"적다","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62051","senseId":"1","lemma":"적다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹는데도","meaning":"强调前面语句所表达的行为，以此表示对现状不满意。","explanation":"먹다：强调前面语句所表达的行为，以此表示对现状不满意。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77243","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살이","meaning":"肉","explanation":"살：肉；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠져요.","meaning":"掉，减轻，变瘦","explanation":"빠지다：掉，减轻，变瘦；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66637","senseId":"10","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"5f930febe6cd0f79","term":"적다","zh":"少，小，欠缺","audio":"/audio/5f930febe6cd0f79ee06.mp3","entryId":"62051","definition":"数、量或程度等达不到一定的标准。","pronunciation":["적ː따"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"强调前面语句所表达的行为，以此表示对现状不满意。","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"77243","definition":"强调前面语句所表达的行为，以此表示对现状不满意。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"人或动物的身体中包裹着骨头的柔软部分。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"掉，减轻，变瘦","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"66637","definition":"肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4aafa97ce63eef8b9a60.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n68801-1-8-2","ko":"살을 빼려면 일단 운동량을 늘려야 합니다.","zh":"要想减肥，首先得增加运动量。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"살을","meaning":"肉","explanation":"살：肉；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빼려면","meaning":"减肥，减重","explanation":"빼다：减肥，减重；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"9","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일단","meaning":"首先","explanation":"일단：首先","readings":[{"term":"일단","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25132","senseId":"1","lemma":"일단","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"운동량을","meaning":"运动量","explanation":"운동량：运动量；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"운동량","audio":"/audio/21b64bcf689e6f5b368e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68801","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"늘려야","meaning":"使增加，使上升","explanation":"늘리다：使增加，使上升；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"늘리다","audio":"/audio/3c64c7ba9cabe0c07c58.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61338","senseId":"2","lemma":"늘리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"합니다.","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"肉","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"人或动物的身体中包裹着骨头的柔软部分。","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"2a9a5583b5aa1796","term":"빼다","zh":"减肥，减重","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3","entryId":"85714","definition":"使肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빼ː다"]},{"id":"47a337529350ca3e","term":"일단","zh":"首先","audio":"/audio/47a337529350ca3ed26b.mp3","entryId":"25132","definition":"最先。","pronunciation":["일딴"]},{"id":"21b64bcf689e6f5b","term":"운동량","zh":"运动量","audio":"/audio/21b64bcf689e6f5b368e.mp3","entryId":"68801","definition":"运动时花费的力气的量。","pronunciation":["운ː동냥"]},{"id":"3c64c7ba9cabe0c0","term":"늘리다","zh":"使增加，使上升","audio":"/audio/3c64c7ba9cabe0c07c58.mp3","entryId":"61338","definition":"使数或量等比原来多。","pronunciation":["늘리다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8d6f40d6a0459a4805fb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.082,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=68801","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.9087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["要想减肥，首先得增加运动量。","我吃得已经很少了，可体重还是降不下来。","最近昼夜温差很大，要注意别感冒哦。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我吃得已经很少了，可体重还是降不下来。","最近昼夜温差很大，要注意别感冒哦。","要想减肥，首先得增加运动量。"],"answer":2}]}
